{
  "group": "imports",
  "description": "Backlog H (2026.10.05): the Spotify import page and its app twin. Files (CSV, Spotify's JSON export and its zip, plain text) and the caps from 45f730c, public links read from stubbed open.spotify.com embed pages, the PKCE sign-in against stubbed accounts.spotify.com and api.spotify.com (state captured from connect's answer), lists kept as Navidrome playlists, and the trickle's controls with Imports__SongsPerHour=0 so nothing is ever fetched. Background reads are awaited with until. Navidrome playlists made here are deleted at the end so later files see none.",
